@startuml
!include ../_fragments/style.puml
!include ../_fragments/legend.puml
BP_STYLE()
BP_LEGEND()


title M9 — Бэктест и метрики


start
partition "Backtest" {
:resolveOrCreate(backtest_params);
:Load candles & signals;
repeat
:Materialize signals (latency model);
:Simulate orders/fills/positions;
:Append sim_* & equity;
repeat while (bars left?)
:Compute performance_aggregate;
}
stop


note right
Метрики: P&L, PF, Expectancy (R), MaxDD, Sharpe/Sortino;\n
отчёты и выбор примеров трейдов с reason‑цепочкой.
end note
@enduml